B.awD=s(["Digits on the drums no longer peek out above and below; two-digit numbers are not cut and get a zero: 01, 02.","Notifications have their own pictures: a plus for +REP, a minus for \u2212REP.","Invite links are shorter, and the QR code is bigger.","The app uses much less data."],t.s)
